145: ## Resume run — what this run did
146: 
147: The inherited implementation (SplitMix64 generator + the fractional-bounds fix in
148: `random_int`) was already merged and its suite was green. This run:
149: 
150: 1. Ran all four gates **before** touching anything. The three cargo gates passed;
151:    `rbops/verify.sh` does not exist in this checkout (see *Gates* and `FINDINGS.md`
152:    §1).
